in the file pass and CI's Verified gate is green on the same tree.\n\nThe test asserts identical results across vendor environments WITHOUT gh; a plausible mechanism is host ambient state (gh installed/authenticated, or other env leakage) reaching the supposedly held-out environment matrix — i.e., the test's isolation is incomplete on hosts with gh present. Not reproduced under CI.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Root cause of the host-vs-CI divergence confirmed per /rebar-debug (hypothesis: ambient gh/env leaking through the vendor-env matrix isolation).\n- [ ] Test passes on a host WITH gh installed and authenticated — proven by `python -m pytest tests/unit/workflow/test_bridge_provider_wrappers_heldout.py -q` locally.\n- [ ] No weakening of the held-out contract (the matrix must still prove gh-independence).\n\n## Testing\nReproduce: run `python -m pytest tests/unit/workflow/test_bridge_provider_wrappers_heldout.py::test_five_environment_matrix_has_identical_results_without_gh -q` on a dev host with gh on PATH.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"3eb6-6e65-539a-4be1","ticket_type":"bug","title":"bridge provider heldout matrix test fails on dev host (passes in CI)","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["19ab7b64-9204-488e-9fdf-6d6980cb799e","9aa9c911-d204-4017-8759-209e96c2be92"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1787454370307525001,"uuid":"71356718-2ee8-4381-aff1-5f3db9b0853b"}